[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0001","text":"舞蹈教练"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0010","text":"1，2，3，4"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0020","text":"好，转体！\n保持重心不要偏移────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0030","text":"……重心，笔直……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0040","text":"甜花，做得很好……！\n已经稳定很多了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0050","text":"嘿嘿……\n教练也夸我了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0060","text":"穿服装的时候……\n需要注意的事情，有好多好多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0070","text":"有了大大的翅膀的话……\n会比平时更容易撞到人……之类的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0080","text":"……所以，把这些\n全部克服掉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0090","text":"能和小奈、千雪小姐……\n一起跳舞就好了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0100","text":"嗯，我也很期待三位的表演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500500_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
